  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 513.25 Docking Structure Repair or Replacement Project Classifications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 513.25 Docking Structure Repair or Replacement Project Classifications. The in kind repair or replacement of an existing legal docking structure, including any accessory structures, shall be a minimum impact project.\n\nSource. #12805, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13124, eff 10-23-20; ss by #13776, eff 10-13-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt500.html"
